@bg soccer_pitch_day
@show jordan
After practice, a tall guy in a football hoodie is waiting by the fence. Jordan sees him and her whole voice changes.
Jordan: (high, soft, sugary) Hiiii, Isiahhh. You came to watch meee?
The entire team freezes. Jordan Ellis. Intense, stubborn, Philly Jordan Ellis. Using a baby voice.
@show maya
Maya: (already recording) I have never been more alive.
@show brooke
Brooke: (very calm, gripping her water bottle so hard it crinkles) Who is THAT.
> [Bold] "That's Isiah. Jordan's new guy. Didn't you know?" -> i1
> [Sweet] "Brooke... are you okay?" -> i2
> [Bitchy] "Jealous, Brooke?" -> i3
> [Good] Mind your business. Stretch. -> i4
*i1
@add Drama 2
@add Brooke_Friendship -1
Brooke: (smiling, terrifying) No. I did not know. How fun.
She drinks her entire water bottle without breathing.
@jump i_done
*i2
@add Brooke_Friendship 3
Brooke: (quietly, still smiling) She used that voice with me. Freshman year. I thought it was only for me.
For a second, the perfect smile slips.
@jump i_done
*i3
@add Brooke_Friendship -2
@add Drama 1
Brooke: Of a FOOTBALL player? Please. I'm thrilled for her. I'm so thrilled I could scream.
She does not scream. She kicks a ball into the parking lot instead.
@jump i_done
*i4
@add Simone_Friendship 1
@show simone
Simone: (stretching next to you) Smart. This one's gonna get loud.
*i_done
@show jordan
Later, in the locker room, Jordan sits next to you and drops her face into her hands.
Jordan: (normal voice) Okay. Don't judge me. I like him. I really like him. And I also... still like Brooke. Like, a lot. Both. At the same time. Is that insane?
> [Sweet] "It's not insane. Feelings don't take turns." -> j1
> [Bold] "Then you have to be honest with both of them." -> j2
> [Bitchy] "It's a little insane. But it's very you." -> j3
