Jordan: (exhaling) ...Okay. Okay. Thank you. Nobody's said that to me.
@jump j_done
*j2
@add Jordan_Friendship 2
Jordan: Honest. Right. Me. Honest. With Brooke. (pause) I'd rather run suicides.
@jump j_done
*j3
@add Jordan_Friendship 2
Jordan: (laughing despite herself) Yeah. It's extremely me.
